<title>USA: Pride Cos Q4 net loss narrows to $0.23.</title>
<headline>Pride Cos Q4 net loss narrows to $0.23.</headline>
<dateline>ABILENE, Texas 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.23		    $0.27</p>
<p> Net loss	  2,382		    2,799</p>
<p> Revs		164,533		  135,678</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  9,950		    9,950</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.63		    $0.85</p>
<p> Net loss	  6,415		    8,617</p>
<p> Revs		615,203		  560,613</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  9,950		    9,950</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is Pride Cos Ltd.</p>
<p>Fourth-quarter 1996 results reflected lower interest and credit and loan fees resulting from restructuring. Operating cash flow for Q4 1996 was $497,000, compared with $2.1 million for the same period the year before.</p>
